The ESMFold2 family reimplements the released ESMFold2 inference path of the Hugging Face transformers port
(transformers v5.24.1, src/transformers/models/esmfold2 and src/transformers/models/esmc) and adapts parts of it.

1. runtime/residue_table.h holds the heavy-atom lists, reference-conformer positions, formal charges, residue types
   and ESM token ids of protein_utils.py (PROTEIN_HEAVY_ATOMS, PROTEIN_REF_POS, PROTEIN_CHARGED_ATOMS,
   PROTEIN_RESIDUE_TO_RES_TYPE, ESM_PROTEIN_VOCAB), and runtime/protein.cpp follows prepare_protein_features:
   https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/v5.24.1/src/transformers/models/esmfold2/protein_utils.py
2. runtime/sampler.cpp follows the noise schedule, the random rotation and augmentation, the weighted rigid
   alignment and the sampling step of generation_esmfold2.py, and runtime/structure_io.cpp the PDB record layout of
   output_to_pdb in protein_utils.py:
   https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/v5.24.1/src/transformers/models/esmfold2/generation_esmfold2.py
3. layers.py and plans.py express the computations of modeling_esmfold2.py and modeling_esmc.py as TensorRT
   networks:
   https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/v5.24.1/src/transformers/models/esmfold2/modeling_esmfold2.py
   https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/v5.24.1/src/transformers/models/esmc/modeling_esmc.py

